{"t": 1789861408.8558927, "kind": "def", "data": {"hash": "216d27630b79e696c33d36fced233d1afb034871350f85836f3b2515eeb0cb5d", "kind": "fill", "slot": "add", "name": "add", "canonical_src": "def add(c1, c2):\n    return complex(c1.real + c2.real, c1.imag + c2.imag)", "raw_src": "@staticmethod\ndef add(c1, c2):\n    \"\"\"\n        Adds two complex numbers.\n        :param c1: The first complex number,complex.\n        :param c2: The second complex number,complex.\n        :return: The sum of the two complex numbers,complex.\n        >>> complexCalculator = ComplexCalculator()\n        >>> complexCalculator.add(1+2j, 3+4j)\n        (4+6j)\n        \"\"\"\n    return complex(c1.real + c2.real, c1.imag + c2.imag)", "slot_refs": [], "helper_refs": [], "unresolved_refs": [], "is_static": true, "meta": {"producer": "whole_class", "arm": "wcr", "round": 0, "sample_idx": 2, "seed": 2453883830}}}
